{"specversion":"1.0","type":"message.created","source":"/microsoft/emails/incremental","id":"8Z2Hr9MdZtudXDaMU6nv5R5293","time":1757965293,"webhook_delivery_attempt":1,"data":{"application_id":"64d65e24-c886-42f7-9c3b-7909e814f322","object":{"attachments":[{"content_id":"008ff253-2580-4405-870a-5c7b5d514e4b","content_type":"image/png","filename":"image.png","grant_id":"8edc6b48-befa-4a8a-8035-7827f25c3af9","id":"AAkALgAAAAAAHYQDEapmEc2byACqAC-EWg0AtZggtlsT7EKcJ7Rjnb8AFAABX1b42wAAARIAEADozx2edm2CQp8m7w-hcAFP","is_inline":true,"size":770}],"bcc":[],"body":"<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><style type=\"text/css\" style=\"display:none\">\r\n<!--\r\np\r\n\t{margin-top:0;\r\n\tmargin-bottom:0}\r\n-->\r\n</style></head><body dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:black\">Hi Ian,</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:1em 0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:black\">We’re excited to let you know that Swift has been selected to be featured on our website! We deeply value the work you do and would love to showcase your company as AI industry leaders that we work with.</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:1em 0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:black\">To ensure your logo looks its best, we kindly ask for:</div><ol start=\"1\" style=\"text-align:left; background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:black\">A <b>vector-based EPS or Adobe Illustrator (AI) file</b>&nbsp;of your logo.</li><li style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:black\">A <b>hyperlink</b>&nbsp;where you’d like users to be directed when they click your logo (e.g., your homepage or a specific landing page).</li></ol><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:1em 0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:black\">This is a great opportunity to highlight your brand in front of our audience, and we’re honored to recognize your contributions. Please reply to this email with your files and link details, or let us know if you have any questions. If you send us your logo, we'll consider that consent to use it on our website and other collateral.</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"text-align:left; text-indent:0px; background-color:rgb(255,255,255); margin:1em 0px; font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:black\">Thank you for being outstanding partners thus far - we are excited to showcase your success.</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" id=\"Signature\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box; border-collapse:collapse; border-spacing:0px\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:white\"><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:16px\">.</div></td></tr><tr><td><table><tbody><tr><td><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><a class=\"OWAAutoLink\" id=\"OWA9ef4f5a4-4892-4228-5b30-3bc3dc61d95a\" href=\"https://blinq.me/LFEvJNJMdtCC\"><img height=\"202\" width=\"540\" id=\"image_0\" alt=\"View my contact details here: https://blinq.me/LFEvJNJMdtCC\" src=\"https://es.blinq.me/wRw7Opvo0IBUqvaOtjpe56zATFS3wqez?c=9QvJ0OV3eW74\" style=\"width:540px; height:202px; min-height:50px\"></a></span></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:rgb(0,0,238)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><u><br></u></span></div><table id=\"pbpsiglinktable\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:22px; height:26px\"><a class=\"OWAAutoLink\" id=\"OWAdba995b3-a410-4159-46fc-8bde937a3f4b\" href=\"https://outlook.office.com/bookwithme/user/2951aa8843e34d61b054417c769945cf@denvrdata.com?anonymous&amp;ep=bwmEmailSignature\"><img size=\"528\" data-outlook-trace=\"F:1|T:1\" src=\"cid:008ff253-2580-4405-870a-5c7b5d514e4b\"></a></td><td style=\"width:2px; height:26px\"></td><td style=\"width:194.031px; height:26px\"><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"color:rgb(0,120,212)\"><a class=\"OWAAutoLink\" id=\"OWA185cb86d-593c-4c38-13a7-ab906771b670\" href=\"https://outlook.office.com/bookwithme/user/2951aa8843e34d61b054417c769945cf@denvrdata.com?anonymous&amp;ep=bwmEmailSignature\" style=\"color:rgb(0,120,212); text-decoration:none\">Book time to meet with </a>me</div></td><td style=\"width:2px; height:26px\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></body></html>","cc":[{"email":"kim@swiftlearning.com","name":"Kim Adolphe"}],"date":1757956139,"folders":["AQMkADJmMWFlNWVlAC0wNzM0LTRmMmItYmM0NS0zODQyY2E3OGFmNDYALgAAA4oYDp5MsaBEqiFttWvcm0oBALWYILZbE_xCnCe0Y52-ABQAAAIBDAAAAA=="],"from":[{"email":"tom@denvrdata.com","name":"Tom Eijzinga"}],"grant_id":"8edc6b48-befa-4a8a-8035-7827f25c3af9","id":"AAkALgAAAAAAHYQDEapmEc2byACqAC-EWg0AtZggtlsT7EKcJ7Rjnb8AFAABX1b42wAA","object":"message","reply_to":[],"snippet":"Hi Ian,\r\nWe’re excited to let you know that Swift has been selected to be featured on our website! We deeply value the work you do and would love to showcase your company as AI industry leaders that we work with.\r\nTo ensure your logo looks its best, we ki","starred":false,"subject":"Swift - Denvr Website Logo","thread_id":"AAQkADJmMWFlNWVlL